== Overshare One
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta

Trabolta: I feel an unexpected need to share with you my true intentions for hosting tonight's Truth Scavenger Hunt.
Trabolta: Why does any man do what he does?
Trabolta: To impress a sweet gal.
Trabolta: Her name is Sandy.
Trabolta: We had a fling this summer. I had the opportunity to ask her to go steady. But all I said was that I would see her after the summer.
Trabolta: I should have shot my shot. But instead, I played it too cool. The reason I am not with you in person tonight is because I am actually in the bathroom stall at a Halloween Dance held elsewhere. I saw Sandy with my rival ten minutes ago and I am going into overdrive. This is unacceptable.
Trabolta: I thought that if I was throwing an incredible high-tech party and I told her about it, she would be interested in coming back with me to see the party, where she would be impressed by how much fun you are all having. I have been recording you all night to show her proof it is a fun party.
Trabolta: But now I am concerned about the computer's defenses. I can't bring her back to a computer in this state.
Trabolta: My systems are reporting that someone managed to bring a virus back from their trip to the Internet, and my antivirus team and I are determined to find out who. You are keeping me from going steady with Sandy.
Trabolta: Separately. My system logs show one of the programs has directly accessed my private LiveJournal stored within the computer. A warning for all of you: do not attempt to find out who read my LiveJournal. You will all be dealt with by the antivirus accordingly.

